///   See also *HostVsanSystem*, *HostVsanSystem.UpdateVsan_Task*, *ComputeResource.ReconfigureComputeResource_Task*.
/// - `vSphereProvisioning`: The VirtualNic is used for vSphere provisioning NFC traffic
